{
    "background_story": "Collins was a renowned mediator, celebrated for his ability to bring people together in accordance with their shared goals. As a young lawyer, he became disillusioned with the adversarial nature of the courtroom and sought a new path. Collins discovered his true calling in mediation, where he could help parties find common ground and resolve disputes amicably. His approach was built on empathy, active listening, and a deep understanding of human nature. Collins' reputation grew as he successfully mediated high-profile cases, from corporate disputes to international conflicts. His mantra, 'Unity in diversity,' reflected his commitment to finding harmony in accordance with the unique perspectives and needs of all parties involved. Through his work, Collins created a legacy of peaceful resolution and inspired a new generation of mediators.",
